<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13232" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό-μοιρα</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>portion,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτηρᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					55.15
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; esp. of a <i>revenue assigned</i> to the
			gods, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς καθηκούσας ἀ. τοῖς θεοῖς . .
				μένειν</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				90.15
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Rosetta</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PEleph.</u>
				14.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRev.Laws</u>
				25.15
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				2.195.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>, etc.: generally, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαφύρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					6.14.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρνίθων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					8.22.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεία ἀ.</span>
			<i>particle</i> of divinity, <i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				2.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>distribution</i> of parts of a victim, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				29.524
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Delos</span>).</div>
